[00:00.00]Good morning, little ducks!|早上好，小鸭子们！
[00:03.00]Wow, so many ducks!|哇，好多鸭子呀！
[00:07.00]Quack, quack! Hello!|嘎嘎！你们好！
[00:10.00]Hold the food bowl, sweetie.|拿好食盆，宝贝。
[00:13.00]Let's take them to the river.|我们带它们去河边吧。
[00:16.00]Come on, little duck!|快来呀，小鸭子！
[00:19.00]Look at how they walk!|你看它们走路的样子！
[00:22.00]Waddle, waddle, left and right!|一摇一摆，左左右右！
[00:26.00]They are so funny!|它们真好玩！
[00:29.00]Hurry up, Big Duck!|快点，大鸭子！
[00:34.46]Whoa! It's coming after me!|哇！它追上来了！
[00:38.18]Slow down, sweetie!|慢点，宝贝！
[00:40.26]Stop chasing me!|别追我啦！
[00:42.94]Why won't it stop?|它怎么不停下来？
[00:47.80]Look at your bowl!|看看你的盆！
[00:50.16]Oh! You are just hungry!|哦！你只是饿了！
[00:54.18]Let's feed them here.|我们在这儿喂它们吧。
[00:59.00]Breakfast time!|早饭时间到！
[01:01.86]All done?|都喂完了吗？
[01:03.78]Yes. Now they're ready to swim.|喂完了。现在它们可以游泳啦。
[01:08.74]Splash! Splash!|扑通！扑通！
[01:11.10]One, two, three, four, five, six, seven.|一、二、三、四、五、六、七。
[01:15.12]They're all together, just like us.|它们都在一起，就像我们一样。
